WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.850
[Soft three-note chime]

00:00:03.532 --> 00:00:06.584
Thinking in weeks can make everyday spending simpler.

00:00:06.898 --> 00:00:10.566
Spending Plan turns your monthly amount into a clear weekly

00:00:10.596 --> 00:00:11.893
amount, plus Buffer.

00:00:12.397 --> 00:00:15.022
That’s a little put aside in case you need more one week.

00:00:15.561 --> 00:00:18.329
You still see the whole month, and you stay in control:

00:00:19.211 --> 00:00:20.462
the app does the maths.

00:00:21.518 --> 00:00:23.954
You make the weekly transfers in your banking app,

00:00:24.363 --> 00:00:26.182
then record those transfers here.

00:00:26.762 --> 00:00:30.241
You don’t need to enter everyday purchases—Spending Plan

00:00:30.271 --> 00:00:32.042
doesn’t track individual transactions.

00:00:32.831 --> 00:00:34.745
It just helps you know your weekly amount.

00:00:36.143 --> 00:00:37.441
Here’s a four-week example.

00:00:38.165 --> 00:00:41.501
You’ve set aside eight hundred and eighty pounds after bills,

00:00:41.768 --> 00:00:44.630
including Buffer. Keep eighty pounds in Buffer.

00:00:45.086 --> 00:00:47.143
That gives you two hundred pounds a week.

00:00:49.599 --> 00:00:52.319
You can tweak the amounts or dates before starting.

00:00:53.101 --> 00:00:55.536
Check your plan, follow the bank setup,

00:00:55.851 --> 00:00:57.148
then start the cycle.

00:00:57.557 --> 00:01:01.557
Each week, move the scheduled weekly amount in your bank and record

00:01:01.634 --> 00:01:02.742
that transfer here.

00:01:04.046 --> 00:01:05.865
Need an extra forty pounds this week?

00:01:06.132 --> 00:01:08.188
Open Top up and enter the amount.

00:01:08.939 --> 00:01:12.922
With two weeks left, the preview takes twenty pounds from each

00:01:12.922 --> 00:01:16.827
later week. Those weekly amounts become a hundred and eighty pounds.

00:01:17.615 --> 00:01:18.818
Buffer stays at eighty.

00:01:19.227 --> 00:01:21.615
Check the preview, move the money in your bank,

00:01:21.976 --> 00:01:23.321
then record the top-up.

00:01:25.882 --> 00:01:27.938
Buffer is there for occasional costs.

00:01:28.442 --> 00:01:31.067
Using it leaves your weekly schedule unchanged.

00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:33.795
A clear amount for this week.

00:01:34.204 --> 00:01:36.498
A clear picture of what’s left for the month.

00:01:37.439 --> 00:01:38.539
[Soft closing chime]

00:01:38.873 --> 00:01:42.210
Spending Plan, your weekly spending companion.
